% in CASES.md section 8.
%
% For manual download instructions, open-access status and the checklist of
% which PDFs to obtain, see JOURNALS.md. Do not cite a paper you have not
% been able to obtain.
%
% DOIs are reproduced exactly as written in the source documents. Entries
% without a DOI omit the doi field, and url fields use only URLs actually
% given in the sources. No DOIs or URLs are invented here.
% =====================================================================

